We are looking for an AI Automation & CRM Integration Specialist to help build and optimize AI-powered customer communication and automation systems across our wellness and fitness brands.

This role will focus on integrating AI chat agents, CRM systems, booking systems, payment gateways, and customer communication platforms to improve operational efficiency, customer experience, and sales conversion.

Key Responsibilities:

Build and manage AI-powered chat automation for Instagram, WhatsApp, Facebook Messenger, and website channels;

Create automated customer flows for inquiries, sales, bookings, package recommendations, and follow-ups;

Integrate booking systems, payment systems, CRM platforms, and communication tools;

Develop workflows connecting Meta Ads, WhatsApp, websites, and payment links;

Set up and optimize chatbot responses for customer FAQs, promotions, memberships, schedules, and onboarding;

Work with management to improve customer journey and sales conversion through automation;

Monitor automation performance and troubleshoot integration issues;

Assist in scaling AI systems for multiple business branches and brands.



Preferred Skills & Experience:

Experience with ManyChat, GoHighLevel (LeadConnector), Zapier, Make.com, or n8n;

Familiarity with AI chatbot systems and conversational AI tools;

Understanding of API integrations and automation workflows;

Experience integrating payment gateways and CRM systems;

Familiarity with WhatsApp API, Meta integrations, and customer automation tools;

Strong problem-solving and systems-thinking ability;

Experience in fitness, wellness, service business, or booking-based industries is a plus.


Our goal is to create a modern AI-assisted customer experience where leads and clients can receive fast, accurate, and automated support for inquiries, bookings, package purchases, and customer service across our brands.

